  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5703.13 Fingerprint Processing Fee",
  "priorExpiration": "2017-02-24",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5703.13 Fingerprint Processing Fee. In addition to any other fees set forth by law or this chapter, the division shall charge an individual a fee of $10.00 for the electronic capture of fingerprint impressions, if required for a criminal record check.\n\nSource. #9396, eff 2-24-09, EXPIRED: 2-24-17\n\nNew. #12132, eff 3-17-17",
